      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Got my hands on an Egyptian artefact today! Reminds me of those days where
    I used to be obsessed with the entire ancient Egyptian civilization...\n\nI still
    can\u2019t believe she got diagnosed with that yesterday. I wish I could be there
    with her but she keeps insisting that doing this project for her is the best
    way I can help her... Thank goodness Auntie is there to accompany her."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1829725b9ea9c8944adc0a664a7da4a9, type: 2}
